 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Against all hope he looked ahead",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And believed in what was not yet seen",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His body felt like deadness grew",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet his trust in God never waned",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He did not waver in unbelief",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But was strengthened in his faith",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gave glory to the God of life",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And believed the promise would come to pass",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Convinced that God has power to act",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To do exactly what He said",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Things that are not become as though they were",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because He gives the dead new breath",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He did not waver in unbelief",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But was strengthened in his faith",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gave glory to the God of life",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And believed the promise would come to pass",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It was credited to him as righteousness",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For he trusted in the living God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We who believe in Him who raised",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Our Lord from the dead share this hope",
